                "text": "For many Americans, specialized hearing devices are critical for communicating. It is unconscionable that insurance companies continue to deny coverage for these essential devices\u2014we intend to stop them.\n\nToday, I reintroduced Ally\u2019s Act a bill named after my 13 yo constituent. https://t.co/Ywf32HLE5N",
